<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="535741167"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:44.080"><div begin="26.882" end="52.394" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="26.882" end="33.284" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.882" end="27.227">每</span><span begin="27.227" end="27.576">一</span><span begin="27.576" end="28.458">次</span><span begin="28.831" end="29.238">都</span><span begin="29.238" end="29.932">在</span><span begin="30.082" end="30.882">徘徊</span><span begin="30.882" end="32.219">孤单中</span><span begin="32.219" end="32.637">坚</span><span begin="32.637" end="33.284">强</span></p><p begin="33.365" end="39.969" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.365" end="33.874">每</span><span begin="33.874" end="34.300">一</span><span begin="34.300" end="35.278">次</span><span begin="35.495" end="36.351">就算</span><span begin="36.351" end="37.617">很受伤</span><span begin="37.617" end="38.032">也</span><span begin="38.032" end="38.778">不闪</span><span begin="38.778" end="39.306">泪</span><span begin="39.306" end="39.969">光</span></p><p begin="40.186" end="46.549" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.186" end="40.511">我</span><span begin="40.511" end="40.927">知</span><span begin="40.927" end="41.719">道</span><span begin="42.255" end="43.381">我一直</span><span begin="43.381" end="44.215">有双</span><span begin="44.215" end="45.031">隐形</span><span begin="45.031" end="45.381">的</span><span begin="45.381" end="45.815">翅</span><span begin="45.815" end="46.549">膀</span></p><p begin="46.854" end="52.394" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.854" end="47.244">带</span><span begin="47.244" end="47.605">我</span><span begin="47.605" end="48.447">飞</span> <span begin="48.794" end="49.327">飞</span><span begin="49.327" end="50.111">过</span><span begin="50.111" end="50.861">绝</span><span begin="50.861" end="52.394">望</span></p></div><div begin="53.440" end="1:18.726" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.440" end="59.931" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.440" end